/-
kvudp's UDP transport's proofs (`notes/kvudp-proof-plan.md`) and the kvnet proofs they reach (the
part `KvNet/`, `notes/kvnet-part.md`), every proof applied to its callees' results: the part's own,
and raft-noax's, `durable`'s, lintest's, porcupine's and Perennial's linked results (their
`Link.lean`s, used as they are). The callees are read off each proof's binders; a proof generic in
kvnet's model parameters is linked at the store's (`etc/link_kvnet.py`'s docstring). Generated by
`etc/gen-link.py --kvudp` -- do not edit by hand.

138 results, 123 of them with no hypothesis. The others take, as hypotheses, the specs no result
proves and the hypotheses of the linked results they use: `h_net_ListenUDP`,
`h_net_UDPConn_ReadFromUDP`, `h_net_UDPConn_WriteToUDP`.

`#print axioms` on a result is its trust base.
-/
